    "updated_at": "2022-02-07T19:01:38Z",
    "body": "> Not sure if there's really a \"fix\" here, but at least maybe output a warning when that operation takes a long time?\r\n\r\nI think it would be reasonable to set a timeout which corresponds to scanning directories. Since it's not an external command, it might be a little harder to time out in a reasonable manner though. We'll see what we can get done.",
